Description: Claw OS — graphical desktop environment
 Installs the Claw OS desktop shell and applications built from the vendored
 desktop workspace, including compositor, greeter, panel, launcher, settings,
 terminal, file manager, editor, store, initial setup, wallpapers, icon theme,
 xdg-desktop-portal integration, office / media / printer / scanner utilities,
 and graphical session wiring.
